LICENCE

minigl.library contains MiniGL and is therefore under the Hyperion MiniGL
Open Source License: AmigaOS only, and the source code of every change is
published: see SOURCE CODE above. RadeonGL's own code is also under the
MIT licence. The R200 microcode is AMD's (MIT). The licence texts are in
the package (the installed drawer's Licences, and Source/LICENSE).


